    {
      "id": "scene_9c044876",
      "chapterId": "chapter_one",
      "name": "02B · 先让茶醒",
      "slug": "02b-先让茶醒",
      "mode": "adv",
      "tags": [
        "ai-generated-acceptance",
        "three-real-assets"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "stage_212592b2",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "stage",
          "action": "set-background",
          "assetId": "bg_alice_tea_room_day",
          "transition": {
            "name": "enter",
            "durationMs": 500
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue_6dfdd477",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char_alice",
          "text": "报告主人：红茶没有生气，只是已经等得开始怀疑自己的冲泡时间。",
          "expressionId": "expr_alice_chibi_normal",
          "position": "center",
          "enter": {
            "name": "enter-from-bottom",
            "durationMs": 420,
            "easing": "backOut"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue_03cd52a2",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char_alice",
          "text": "这是我替它说的。它本人暂时保持沉默。"
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue_0bdf69dc",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char_alice",
          "text": "不过，停下来喝一口以后，刚才那句话也许会变得没那么锋利。"
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue_85b66c79",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char_alice",
          "text": "你想回去把它说完，还是把答案留在今天的最后？"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_8132ebcc",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "choice",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "tea_return",
              "label": "回到刚才的话题",
              "targetSceneId": "scene_7f6b7a36"
            },
            {
              "id": "tea_promise",
              "label": "把约定写进书签",
              "targetSceneId": "scene_d43796bc"
            }
          ],
          "prompt": "接下来怎么做？"
        }
      ],
      "aiContext": "短暂的 Q 版演出缓和气氛，玩家可以返回谈话或继续作出约定。只使用已登记的三份真实素材；没有 BGM，因此保持静音。",
      "summary": "短暂的 Q 版演出缓和气氛，玩家可以返回谈话或继续作出约定",
      "entryStage": {
