    {
      "id": "scene_d43796bc",
      "chapterId": "chapter_one",
      "name": "03 · 留给明天的问题",
      "slug": "03-留给明天的问题",
      "mode": "adv",
      "tags": [
        "ai-generated-acceptance",
        "three-real-assets"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "stage_81163708",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "stage",
          "action": "set-background",
          "assetId": "bg_alice_tea_room_day",
          "transition": {
            "name": "enter",
            "durationMs": 500
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue_de2e9189",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char_alice",
          "text": "谢谢你愿意说到这里。剩下的部分，不必为了让今天完整而勉强补上。",
          "expressionId": "expr_alice_standard_normal",
          "position": "right",
          "enter": {
            "name": "enter",
            "durationMs": 360,
            "easing": "easeOut"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue_99b61ac0",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char_alice",
          "text": "我们只约定一件事：明天醒来以后，先替自己决定一件真正重要的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue_ef5bdbea",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char_alice",
          "text": "不是最紧急的，也不是别人最期待的。只是一件你愿意承认重要的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue_786ad26e",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char_alice",
          "text": "我会把空白留在这张书签上。等你想写的时候，再交给我。"
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue_0fe71eed",
          "source": "ai",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char_alice",
          "text": "现在，红茶的温度刚好。欢迎回来，主人。"
        }
      ],
      "aiContext": "爱丽丝恢复标准构图，与主人约定明天只处理一件真正重要的事。只使用已登记的三份真实素材；没有 BGM，因此保持静音。",
      "summary": "爱丽丝恢复标准构图，与主人约定明天只处理一件真正重要的事",
